        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-POLY-COMPLEX.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-POLY-COMPLEX-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH481-DUAL-POTENTIAL-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH482-STATOR-CONJ-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH483-ROTOR-SYNC-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH484-COMPLEX-SAAT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH485-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-POLY-COMPLEX-WIT    PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-POLY-COMPLEX.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-POLY-COMPLEX.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH481-DUAL-POTENTIAL-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH482-STATOR-CONJ-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH483-ROTOR-SYNC-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH484-COMPLEX-SAAT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH485-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FPGA-POLY-COMPLEX-WIT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FPGA-POLY-COMPLEX-WIT.
